ed from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","hook":"Class II–IV rapids between Misti and Chachani; cold water, altitude Guided/outfitter only. Confirm water-safety gear before booking","si":"expedition","blurb":"Class II–IV rapids between Misti and Chachani; cold water, altitude Guided/outfitter only. Confirm water-safety gear before booking","when":"April–November","commission":"rafting outfitter (net-rate)"},{"name":"Chivay & La Calera hot springs","si_tag":"expedition","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"included in tour; entry non-commissionable","source":"https://www.peruforless.com/blog/colca-canyon","timing":"April–November","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"expedition","when":"April–November","commission":"included in tour; entry non-commissionable"},{"name":"Santa Catalina Monastery","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"guided city tour; entry non-commissionable","source":"https://www.theonlyperuguide.com/research/things-to-do-in-arequipa-colonial-city-colca-canyon-local-culture/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","hook":"The monastery covers ~215,000 sq ft of streets, cloisters, and gardens — plan two to three hours","si":"culture","blurb":"The monastery covers ~215,000 sq ft of streets, cloisters, and gardens — plan two to three hours","when":"year-round","commission":"guided city tour; entry non-commissionable"},{"name":"Juanita the Ice Maiden (Andean Sanctuaries Museum)","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"essential","commission_path":"included in city tour; entry non-commissionable","source":"https://www.peruforless.com/blog/inca-ice-maiden","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"included in city tour; entry non-commissionable"},{"name":"Yanahuara mirador","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"essential","commission_path":"included in city tour","source":"https://www.exoticca.com/us/blog/things-to-do-in-arequipa-must-see-hidden-gems/","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"culture","when":"year-round","commission":"included in city tour"},{"name":"Sabandía Mill","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"essential","commission_path":"countryside/city tour add-on","source":"https://www.exoticca.com/us/blog/things-to-do-in-arequipa-must-see-hidden-gems/","timing":"April–November","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"culture","when":"April–November","commission":"countryside/city tour add-on"},{"name":"Toro Muerto petroglyphs","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"full-day guided excursion (net-rate)","source":"https://www.exoticca.com/us/blog/things-to-do-in-arequipa-must-see-hidden-gems/","timing":"April–November","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"culture","when":"April–November","commission":"full-day guided excursion (net-rate)"},{"name":"Picantería crawl (La Nueva Palomino)","si_tag":"C&H","tier":"comfort","commission_path":"culinary tour / dining add-on","source":"https://larepublica.pe/datos-lr/respuestas/2022/12/05/la-historia-de-la-nueva-palomino-la-picanteria-mas-famosa-de-arequipa-como-empezo-este-legado-familiar-gastronomia-peruana-evat","timing":"April–November","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"culture","when":"April–November","commission":"culinary tour / dining add-on"}],"faq":null,"seo":{"meta_title":"Arequipa & Colca Canyon, Peru: Condors, White-Stone City & High-Altitude Adventure | TravelWell","jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","search_language":"es-PE","local_keywords":["qué hacer en Arequipa","Cañón del Colca cóndores","Monasterio Santa Catalina","Cruz del Cóndor mejor hora","mejor época Colca Canyon","picanterías Arequipa rocoto relleno","escalar el Misti"],"hreflang":["en","es-PE"],"author_byline":"By David McCallister — commercial pilot, 56 countries","freshness":"2026-07-07"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":